## Overview

### Project Scope

A simple e-commerce API with:
- User authentication (register, login, logout)
- Product catalog
- Shopping cart (persistent, per-user)
- Shopping checkout
- Order management
- Payment processing (Stripe)

### Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Framework | Laravel 12 |
| PHP Version | 8.3 |
| Database | MySQL 8.0 |
| Cache | Redis |
| Queue | Redis |
| Auth | Laravel Sanctum |
| Payment | Stripe |
| Containerization | Docker |

